ce/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"この軍配に書いてある文字が目に入らぬかー！！　そうだ！　天下無敵ぃっ！！　最強になったハツカゼちゃんにひれふせーい！！","en":"Can't you see the characters written on this military flag? That's right! I'm invincible! You should be prostrating yourselves before me, the strongest Hatsukaze!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"私が弱っちい人間たちを救ってやろうと言ってるんだよー！　でもタダでというのは気が引けるだろー？　だから貢ぎ物を用意せいっ！","en":"I'm saying I'll save you weak humans, but I don't think I can do it for free. So, prepare some offerings for me!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"うーむ、改めて大人の魅力が出すぎている気がするなー？　ふうまはチョロいから、この格好でねだれば何でも買ってくれるに違いない！","en":"Hmm, I think my adult charm is a bit too much, don't you? As a Fuuma, I'm sure I can get anything I want if I just ask for it in this outfit."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"むっふっふー……この力があればなんだってできる気がするぞー！　道端で披露すれば、きっとお金がザックザク手に入るはずだぁー！！","en":"Muahahaha... with this power, I feel like I can do anything! If I show it off on the street, I'm sure I'll get all the money I want!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"ふうまめぇ……最近また知らん女と話しているのを見たぞ？　私という美少女がいながら何ごとだー！　これはもうわからせるしかないっ！","en":"Fuuma, I saw you talking to some other woman again! What's wrong with you, when you have a beautiful girl like me?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"まったく……私が日々徳を積んでいるというのに、しもべに志願してくる奴がいないぞー！？　本当に見る目がない人間ばかりだなー！","en":"It's really frustrating... I've been accumulating virtue every day, but no one wants to be my servant. I guess humans just don't have any taste."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"なに～～？　服に隙間がある、だとー？　これは必要な空間なんだよー！　えーっとアレだ、余白の美……みたいなやつと同じだよ！！","en":"What's wrong with you? You're saying my clothes have gaps? This is necessary space! It's like, um, the beauty of empty space or something!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"むっふっふー！　ハツカゼちゃんのないすばでぃに惚れ込んでいるのかー？　おっぱいに触りたいなら、特別に許可してやらなくもない！","en":"Muahahaha! Have you fallen for my nice body? If you want to touch my breasts, I might just give you special permission!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00874_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"んはぁあっ、もうザーメンでドロドロだぁ……。パンツの上からぶっかけたいとは、本当に好き者だなー！　ほら、もう一発出してみるか？","en":"Ahhh, I'm all wet and sticky now... you really are a pervert, aren't you? You want to cum all over my pants? Well, go ahead and do it again if you want!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00874_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"あはぁっ、チンポぉ……チンポが欲しいー！　強くなったのは性欲も同じみたいだぁ……。早くオマンコに挿れてくれぇー！！　んぅうう！","en":"Ahhh, I want a dick... my desire is just as strong as my strength. Put it in my pussy already! Ahhh, ahhh!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00874_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00874_1/uni00874_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":